  "implementation": [
    "Additive C entry point and extension struct; all previous C struct declarations preserved",
    "Failure-atomic dependence and optional joint matrix reads, no reevaluation",
    "Original Python 19-field result preserved; new immutable extended snapshot",
    "Version 2 JSON tasks and results expose optional latent matrix and accepted-row joint statistics",
    "Version 1 options/result shape and independent random stream preserved",
    "Matrix/options/version frozen before user callbacks; safe fatal and extraction cleanup",
    "Installed C consumer uses the new extension; Windows prior binary and Linux prior-source/SDK consumer run against new libraries"
  ],
