    "Pure C query bounds/overlap/failure atomicity, frozen input and reentrant callbacks",
    "18 Python tests cover six distributions, paired covariance, scale extremes, failures/cancellation and handle cleanup",
    "Version 2 tasks execute all nine analysis formats",
    "CLI protects source/Touchstone hardlinks and old outputs on invalid requests",
    "4096 task parameter samples exactly match corresponding native C++ samples",
    "RF powers, sample moments, covariance/correlation and quantiles independently recomputed",
    "Legacy native output exactly matches previous stage in each environment"
  ],
